msgid ""
"**Goal:** Install the environment, then run a robot demo (`hardware` "
"default `mock_components`)."
msgstr "**目标：** 先安装环境，再运行机器人演示（`hardware` 默认为 `mock_components`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:41
#: 1db5900d26304def83e45e8f10c08a2c
msgid ""
"[Install Environment](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — "
"Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy + rosdep. On a bare host: add the ROS apt "
"source, then `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-tools` (fishros is optional)."
" Workspace entry is `./init_repo.sh`, then `source install/setup.bash`."
msgstr ""
"[环境安装](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — Ubuntu 24.04、ROS "
"2 Jazzy + rosdep。裸机上：先加 ROS apt 源，再装 `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-"
"tools`（fishros 可选）。工作区入口是 `./init_repo.sh`，然后 `source "
"install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:42
#: 091f4ba23deb42009eaa26b59ce634b5
msgid "Clone `open-deploy-ws` and run the official init script:"
msgstr "克隆 `open-deploy-ws` 并运行官方初始化脚本："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:43
#: b6b1f0b9cfb34464846eb08abe2695a0
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:48
#: 122c5f52b0294535b423cceca9d48ea9
msgid "Build the workspace:"
msgstr "编译工作空间："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:49
#: 1a6f3283203641668f764dce63dfa565
msgid "colcon build --symlink-install\n"
msgstr "colcon build --symlink-install\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:52
#: a61bb11f34084bf1bf622f259e120903
msgid ""
"Launch the demo (defaults: `robot:=cr5`, `hardware:=mock_components` — "
"omit both; there is no `hardware:=mock`):"
msgstr ""
"启动演示（默认：`robot:=cr5`、`hardware:=mock_components` — 两者都可省略；没有 "
"`hardware:=mock`）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:53
#: 14e4a6b16e1c42c39377c3f89ac405fa
msgid ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"
msgstr ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"

